The temperatures is a list of 73, 74, 75, 71, 69, 72, 76, and 73.
The last is the last position of temperatures.
The wait is a list of 8 zeros.
The stack is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every day from 0 to last.
The settled is 0.
Repeat while settled is 0.
The end is the last position of stack.
If end is less than 0, Place day into stack, set settled to 1, stop.
The top is item end of stack.
If item day of temperatures is more than item top of temperatures, remove the last item from stack, set item top of wait to day minus top.
If item day of temperatures is at most item top of temperatures, Place day into stack, set settled to 1, stop.

The line is empty text.
For each value in wait.
If the length of line is more than 0, Place "," into line.
Place format whole number value as text into line.

Show line.
